msgstr "Impossible: Vg must be negative, and the drop across Ra less than B+."

#: src/GUI/DialogAudioLampy.cpp:1062
msgid ""
"Rk = Uk / (Ia + Ig2).  Ck: spadek wzmocnienia o 3 dB przy fd, z równania |(1"
