"2)."
msgstr ""
"Rk = Uk / (Ia + Ig2).  Ck: gain drop of 3 dB at fd, from |(1 + jx) / (1 + "
"gm·Rk + jx)| = 1/√2, i.e. x = 2π·fd·Rk·Ck = √((1 + gm·Rk)² − 2)."

